WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,090
And half a bottle of water

2
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:07,400
Why are you like this?

3
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:11,150
Let me drink it, everyone

4
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:12,270
There are so many of us

5
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:13,750
You're almost done. Why don't we drink?

6
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:15,350
Zhang Xu I want to drink

7
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:24,460
Don't want to take us

8
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,710
They don’t want us to follow the young lady either.

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:32,070
I know the map here can take you out, but only if you take us with you.

10
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:33,870
At most you are allowed to follow

11
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,350
Conceited about life and death

12
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:38,830
Don't cause trouble, come here

13
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,270
The young lady allowed us to follow.

14
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:43,340
say it again

15
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,020
You are responsible for your own life and death

16
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,380
I won't stop for anyone
